{"version":2,"sourceHash":"8ba562241517e1e324fbb5326f4ec69210a15b0a6dae5c333b57fe04c2e0c36e","locale":"zh-TW","id":"ep-45","no":"EP.45","tag":"第45話 · 月亮與太陽","title":"月亮與太陽","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-45:1","s":"n","t":"十八號牌，月亮。天空掛著兩輪月，一輪泛著冷光，另一輪黑得像它的影子。","bg":"clearMoonWater","tone":"dark","bgm":"midnightPulse","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"c":{"who":"pje","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"},"sfx":"whoosh","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-45:2","s":"n","t":"路兩側各立著一座塔。遠處狗與狼輪流嚎叫，直到最後也辨不清哪邊才是狗。"},{"id":"ep-45:3","s":"yun","t":"月亮牌只有一個規則，別相信眼見的一切。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:4","s":"moka","t":"那信什麼？閉眼走嗎？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:5","s":"yun","t":"相信彼此。牽住手，叫名字，確認有沒有回應。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-45:6","s":"n","t":"Yeoni摸了摸口袋裡的備忘本。紙角碰到指尖，光是這樣，就稍稍安心了。"},{"id":"ep-45:7","s":"yeon","t":"（認不得站在我這邊的人的臉，但認得記著他的字。這樣就夠了。）","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-45:8","s":"n","t":"每個水窪都映著月亮，也映著Yeoni。她停下腳步，水裡的她卻慢半拍才停。"},{"id":"ep-45:9","s":"yeon","t":"那傢伙一直在學我，可總是慢一點。","x":"fear","im":true,"fx":"veil","sfx":"glitch","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"veil","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:10","s":"pje","t":"別看，繞過水窪，不要踩。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:11","s":"n","t":"這時霧落了下來，從腳踝到膝蓋，再從膝蓋到肩膀，只在一瞬間。"},{"id":"ep-45:12","s":"moka","t":"喂，手！牽住手！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:13","s":"n","t":"Yeoni伸出手，指尖擦過什麼，又錯失了。霧裡，大家的聲音越來越遠。"},{"id":"ep-45:14","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨撐開傘站著。纏著膠帶的傘骨推開少許霧氣，身旁只剩閏月。","bg":"clearMoonWater","tone":"dark","bgm":"zeroPoint","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"pje","x":"serious"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"},"sfx":"none","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-45:15","s":"yun","t":"摩卡和Yeoni去了另一邊，聽聲音是這樣。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:16","s":"pje","t":"不是說這張牌裡，聲音也不能信嗎？","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:17","s":"yun","t":"對，所以現在我的話也只信一半吧。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-45:18","s":"n","t":"霧的另一頭傳來腳步聲。先看見黃色書包，然後是Yeoni的臉。"},{"id":"ep-45:19","s":"yeon","t":"寒雨！找到妳了，閏月先生也在。","x":"smile","c":{"who":"yeon","x":"smile"}},{"id":"ep-45:20","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨剛想向前邁半步，又停住。Yeoni的運動鞋是乾的，明明經過了那麼多水窪。"},{"id":"ep-45:21","s":"pje","t":"摩卡先生呢？","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-45:22","s":"yeon","t":"在那邊走散了。不過先別說那個，寒雨，我剛才一直在想。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-45:23","s":"yeon","t":"Neo被吞掉，不都是因為妳嗎？","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:24","s":"n","t":"霧裡安靜下來，狗和狼都不叫了。"},{"id":"ep-45:25","s":"pje","t":"Yeoni。","x":"waver","im":true,"shot":"impact","sfx":"heartbeat","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 pje의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:26","s":"yeon","t":"第一個春天不也是妳嗎？門是妳打開的。這次妳站在前面，Neo卻還是被吃了。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:27","s":"yun","t":"Yeoni，那是……","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:28","s":"yeon","t":"閏月先生別插手，這是我們兩個的事。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:29","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨的傘尖顫抖著。嘴唇動了動，想回答，卻沒有聲音。那句話，正是她每晚寫在帳本上的話。"},{"id":"ep-45:30","s":"pje","t":"是，所以我想償還……","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-45:31","s":"yeon","t":"那就先把傘給我，那個本來就是我的。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-45:32","s":"n","t":"雨開始下了，是月光裡的雨。這時另一串腳步穿破霧氣奔來。啪嗒、啪嗒，逕直踩進水窪的聲音。","bg":"clearMoonWater","tone":"dark","shot":"close","sfx":"rain","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-45:33","s":"n","t":"第二個Yeoni出現了，從頭到運動鞋全濕透，膝蓋留著摔倒的痕跡。摩卡氣喘吁吁地跟在後面。"},{"id":"ep-45:34","s":"moka","t":"那是什麼！怎麼有兩個Yeoni！","x":"angry","im":true,"fx":"shake","sfx":"thud","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"shake","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 moka의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:35","s":"yun","t":"啊，這下連信一半都不行了。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-45:36","s":"n","t":"濕透的Yeoni看著乾燥的Yeoni，乾燥的也看著濕透的。兩張臉一模一樣，連眼下的浮腫也一樣。"},{"id":"ep-45:37","s":"yeon","t":"妳是什麼東西，用我的臉做什麼？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:38","s":"yeon","t":"這才是我想問的。寒雨，她是假的。記得剛才在水窪裡笑的那個吧？","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-45:39","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨輪流看著兩人。乾燥的Yeoni那笑容很熟悉，熟悉得讓她窒息。"},{"id":"ep-45:40","s":"yun","t":"來查證一下。Yeoni的出生年月日時。","x":"serious","bg":"clearMoonWater","tone":"dark","shot":"wide","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 yun의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-45:41","s":"yeon","t":"二〇〇二年七月六日，八點半，乙亥日柱。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-45:42","s":"yeon","t":"沒錯，是我。可她也知道啊！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:43","s":"yun","t":"兩個都答對了。黑月吞食命式，靠數字分不出來。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-45:44","s":"moka","t":"那我來。Yeoni，第一次給我打幾顆星？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:45","s":"yeon","t":"兩顆，因為那味道簡直犯罪。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-45:46","s":"yeon","t":"兩顆！不是吧，連這個也知道？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:47","s":"moka","t":"這也都答對了，真要瘋了。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:48","s":"n","t":"雨更大了。濕透的Yeoni牙齒打顫。乾燥的Yeoni淋著雨，卻一點不濕。沒有人冷靜到能指出這一點。"},{"id":"ep-45:49","s":"heuk","t":"反正是同一張臉啊，雨水。第一個春天，妳不也選不出來嗎？"},{"id":"ep-45:50","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨抬起頭。那個聲音，是從車站長椅後傳來、第一次把帳本交給她的聲音。","bg":"clearMoonWater","tone":"dark","shot":"close","sfx":"rain","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-45:51","s":"pje","t":"那時選不了。這次我可以選。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:52","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨收起傘。雨直接澆到她頭上，冰涼的雨水滲入大衣內側。"},{"id":"ep-45:53","s":"n","t":"乾燥的Yeoni伸出手，伸向徐寒雨手裡的傘。","im":true,"shot":"impact","sfx":"none","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:54","s":"yeon","t":"做得好，拿過來吧，那是我的。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-45:55","s":"n","t":"濕透的Yeoni也動了，牙齒打顫，踉蹌著走向徐寒雨。然後舉起書包遮住她的頭，自己的頭卻依舊淋在雨裡。"},{"id":"ep-45:56","s":"yeon","t":"傻瓜，為什麼收傘，會感冒的。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:57","s":"n","t":"雨水沿黃色書包分開，徐寒雨頭上有了一小片屋頂，笨拙、歪斜，只有一半。","im":true,"fx":"water","sfx":"water","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"water","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:58","s":"pje","t":"真正的Yeoni會先遞傘，不會開口要。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-45:59","s":"pje","t":"沒有傘，拿書包也會。","x":"resolve"},{"id":"ep-45:60","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨轉向乾燥的Yeoni，收起的傘尖對準了她的胸口。"},{"id":"ep-45:61","s":"pje","t":"把那張臉摘下來。那不是你有資格擁有的臉。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:62","s":"n","t":"乾燥的Yeoni仍笑著，臉卻裂開了。縫隙裡透出黑光，嘴角裂到了耳邊。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"dark","bgm":"crisis2","shot":"impact","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"sfx":"glitch","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-45:63","s":"heuk","t":"可惜，本想這次多用一陣。","im":true,"fx":"hands","sfx":"glitch","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"hands","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 heuk의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:64","s":"n","t":"臉一片片脫落，下面空無一物。只有一個黑圓吞著月光，正是兩輪月中漆黑的那輪。"},{"id":"ep-45:65","s":"heuk","t":"但沒關係。在月亮牌裡，我能變成任何人，你們的媽媽、朋友，還有那隻貓。"},{"id":"ep-45:66","s":"n","t":"霧裡浮現Yeoni、徐寒雨和摩卡的臉。後面還有一個銀髮、穿深藍衣服的人。"},{"id":"ep-45:67","s":"yeon","t":"Neo。","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-45:68","s":"n","t":"名字先脫口而出。明明想不起是誰，一看到銀色衣襬，指尖就發顫。"},{"id":"ep-45:69","s":"yun","t":"Yeoni，那是假的。真正的他衣服沒那麼完整。為了遮住受傷的手臂，袖口早都磨破了。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:70","s":"yeon","t":"怎麼現在才告訴我，這樣不是更想見他了。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-45:71","s":"moka","t":"夠了，都讓開。對付謊言就用火。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:72","s":"n","t":"摩卡擦燃火柴，把剩下的兩根一起劃亮。火焰從指間長大，衝向天空。","bg":"siksang5","bgm":"fireFestival","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"surprise"},"c":{"who":"moka","x":"base"},"r":{"who":"pje","x":"surprise"},"sfx":"fire","scene":{"background":"siksang5","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang5","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang5 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-45:73","s":"n","t":"太陽升起來了。十九號牌，太陽。霧瞬間燃燒，藏在月光裡的臉像紙一樣捲曲消失。","im":true,"fx":"fire","sfx":"fire","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"siksang5","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang5","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"fire","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang5 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:74","s":"n","t":"睜開眼，眾人站在熟悉的舞臺上，上方掛著正午太陽。太陽牌裡的世界，很像摩卡的島。"},{"id":"ep-45:75","s":"moka","t":"我們島啊，太陽回來那天的舞臺。","x":"moved"},{"id":"ep-45:76","s":"yeon","t":"摩卡原來真是太陽，兩根火柴就升起一輪太陽。","x":"happy"},{"id":"ep-45:77","s":"moka","t":"意思是，兩根都用完了。我現在兩手空空，你們負責。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:78","s":"pje","t":"要記帳嗎？兩根火柴，未收款。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-45:79","s":"moka","t":"妳不是說那本帳寫不了了嗎！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:80","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨沒回答，甩了甩濕髮，向Yeoni伸出手。Yeoni握住了，兩個人都還濕著。"},{"id":"ep-45:81","s":"yeon","t":"寒雨，謝謝妳剛才那句話。不過我也糊塗了，差點以為那個才是我。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-45:82","s":"pje","t":"我也分不清，笑起來一模一樣。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-45:83","s":"yeon","t":"那妳憑什麼選的？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-45:84","s":"pje","t":"濕的那一邊。Yeoni總是在淋濕的那一邊。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-45:85","s":"n","t":"太陽牌的舞臺後有一道敞開的門，門後傳來號角聲。二十號牌，審判。","bg":"fateTarot","bgm":"fortuneReveal","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"c":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"pje","x":"base"},"sfx":"bell","scene":{"background":"fateTarot","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: fateTarot","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"fateTarot 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-45:86","s":"n","t":"天空的天使每吹一次號，地上就浮起一個名字，都是被黑月吞掉的名字。但它們又沉下去，因為沒人呼喚。"},{"id":"ep-45:87","s":"yun","t":"審判是呼喚之牌，有人呼喚，名字才會起身。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:88","s":"yeon","t":"那我來叫不就好了。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:89","s":"yun","t":"要認識名字的主人才叫得了。妳認識的名字不多，我連自己的名字也不知道。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-45:90","s":"n","t":"閏月握緊戴手套的手，掌心裡透出黑色。空亡擴大了一點。"},{"id":"ep-45:91","s":"yeon","t":"你的手，比剛才大了。","x":"sad","im":true,"shot":"close","sfx":"heartbeat","scene":{"background":"fateTarot","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: fateTarot","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"fateTarot 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:92","s":"yun","t":"今天吞了點霧。沒事，目前還塞得進手套。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-45:93","s":"n","t":"下一道門是二十一號，世界。圓形月桂環裡有人起舞，那是愚者旅程終結的牌。"},{"id":"ep-45:94","s":"yeon","t":"到結尾，就該去黑月那裡了？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-45:95","s":"yun","t":"原本在二十一號結束。愚者是零號，所以總共二十二張。但你們看。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:96","s":"n","t":"月桂環下，牌與牌之間有一道窄縫，寬得剛好能放進一張牌。風從縫裡漏出來。"},{"id":"ep-45:97","s":"sys","t":"[ 23 · THE DOOR ]","im":true,"fx":"tarot","sfx":"page","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"fateTarot","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: fateTarot","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"tarot","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"fateTarot 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:98","s":"n","t":"文字在縫上浮起，又消失了。Yeoni見過那些字，第一晚的房間裡，在這一切開始之前。"},{"id":"ep-45:99","s":"yeon","t":"那扇門，我認識，在我房間裡的。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-45:100","s":"n","t":"縫隙張開，顯出一扇木門。把手老舊，門牌的位置空著，沒有寫任何名字。","bg":"tarotDoor","tone":"dark","bgm":"zeroPoint","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"c":{"who":"pje","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"moka","x":"base"},"sfx":"door","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-45:101","s":"pje","t":"這回門牌空了，連可讀的都沒有。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:102","s":"moka","t":"那更嚇人好不好。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-45:103","s":"n","t":"閏月站到門前，脫下手套。掌心的黑圓向門傾斜，像水往低處流。"},{"id":"ep-45:104","s":"yun","t":"門後和我掌心一樣的氣味，空空的氣味。","x":"pain","im":true,"fx":"suck","sfx":"whoosh","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"suck","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 yun의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:105","s":"yun","t":"是空亡，黑月的家。大概也是貓先生所在的地方。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:106","s":"yeon","t":"那就開。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:107","s":"yun","t":"真果斷。進去以後，五片天空都會向那裡崩塌。做好準備了嗎？","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-45:108","s":"yeon","t":"備忘上寫了，想不起來也去。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-45:109","s":"n","t":"Yeoni握住門把，冰涼。這時，門後傳來聲音，非常輕，卻清晰。"},{"id":"ep-45:110","s":"n","t":"「襪子，要穿成一對。」","im":true,"shot":"quiet","sfx":"none","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:111","s":"n","t":"Yeoni的手僵在門把上。她不知道是誰的聲音，眼淚卻先流了下來。她低頭看自己的腳，襪子不成對。"}]}
